The A-1 Keep (and the K-2 th Keep) reverted to *://*.amazon.*/* alone, which
does not match amazon.com.be: Compile fails, naming (tag,
*://*.amazon.com.be/*) and the other five protected names. With the AMZ fix
(the real overlay) it passes.
-- ops --
run Compile
pass
jset rules/overlay/overlay.json [{"id": "amazon-affiliate-keep"}, "include"] ["*://*.amazon.*/*"]
jset rules/overlay/overlay.json [{"id": "amazon-th"}, "include"] ["*://*.amazon.*/*"]
run Compile
fail strips "tag" at *://*.amazon.com.be/*
fail strips "ascsubtag" at *://*.amazon.com.be/*
fail strips "geniuslink" at *://*.amazon.com.be/*
fail strips "linkCode" at *://*.amazon.com.be/*
fail strips "linkId" at *://*.amazon.com.be/*
fail strips "th" at *://*.amazon.com.be/*
